  <https://math.csudh.edu/~pong/a3/Notes_01.html>
- Thomson–Bruckner–Bruckner, *Elementary Real Analysis*:
  <https://people.math.sc.edu/girardi/m5545/TBB-AllChapters-Landscape.pdf>
