lem-bw-implies-cauchy-complete	lemma	"Bolzano-Weierstrass implies Cauchy completeness in any ordered field"
Let $F$ be an ordered field with the Bolzano-Weierstrass property (BW) of [[def-completeness-properties]]. Then $F$ has Cauchy completeness (CC): every Cauchy sequence in $F$ converges in $F$. No Archimedean hypothesis is needed here, and none is hidden: (BW) already carries the Archimedean property on its own ([[lem-bw-implies-archimedean]]), but that fact is not used below.
