thm-complete-and-totally-bounded-uniform-spaces-are-compact	theorem	"Assuming the ultrafilter lemma, every complete and totally bounded uniform space is compact"
**Assume the ultrafilter lemma.** Every complete and totally bounded uniform space is compact.
