thm-countably-based-uniformity-is-pseudometrizable	theorem	"Every countably based uniformity is generated by one pseudometric, which is a metric exactly when the uniformity is separated"
Every countably based uniformity is generated by one pseudometric. That pseudometric is a metric exactly when the uniformity is separated.
